# Alpha OS — base system — Ubuntu 26.04 LTS (resolute)
# Provenance: package names verified as exact matches against
#   archive.ubuntu.com/ubuntu/dists/resolute/{main,restricted,universe,multiverse}/binary-amd64/Packages.gz
# Suite is RELEASED (Release dated 23 Apr 2026). One package per line, no versions.
#
# ARCHITECTURAL NOTE (applies to every *-desktop list in this directory):
# The four flavour metapackages (ubuntu-desktop, ubuntucinnamon-desktop,
# kubuntu-desktop, xubuntu-desktop) all exist, but ubuntu-desktop-minimal
# declares `Conflicts: kubuntu-desktop-minimal xubuntu-desktop-minimal`, so
# co-installing multiple Ubuntu flavours is unsatisfiable. Alpha OS therefore
# lists component packages instead of flavour metapackages, so all four
# desktops can coexist in one image.
# VERIFY: whether ubuntucinnamon-desktop also declares a Conflicts stanza is
# unconfirmed; this only matters if the flavour metapackages are ever revisited.
#
# `systemd` is intentionally NOT listed (it is pulled in by ubuntu-minimal and
# we never want to fight the base). `ubiquity` is intentionally NOT listed:
# the installer comes from the `--debian-installer live` live-build hook.

ubuntu-minimal
ubuntu-standard
tasksel
tasksel-data
casper
live-boot
os-prober
laptop-detect
cryptsetup
mtools
dosfstools
syslinux
syslinux-common
